@@ -1,5 +1,14 @@
 # MCP module learnings
 
+## Model-facing server names must remain callable
+
+Protocol tool descriptions listed humanized server names while execution required exact
+configuration identifiers, so following the description produced an unknown-server error.
+Descriptions and errors now quote exact identifiers. Protocol calls also resolve an exact,
+unique humanized name to its identifier; an exact identifier wins, and ambiguous display names
+are refused rather than guessed. Registrations, module API names, and permission checks stay
+unchanged.
+
 ## Model guidance uses the resolved configuration path
 
 The user-wide tools wrote the correct file but described the macOS-only `~/Happy/Config` path
